	"system": {
		"description": "<p>This shape fills three 5ft unoccupied squares that must form a connected line within the cantrip’s range until the end of your next turn. A creature that begins or ends their turn adjacent to the wall, or who passes through the wall on their turn, takes damage. A creature that makes a successful Wisdom save against your spell save DC takes half damage.</p>",
